			"notes": "## Minecraft 26.2 now requires Meteor Client b33 or newer!\n\n## 🚀 New Features\n\n* **Shadows:** Rounded rectangles can now render soft shadows.\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  <img width=\"273\" height=\"201\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61ce1bec-937e-4147-8120-5652ba604d83\" />\n  </details>\n\n* **Color Links:** Color settings can now be linked to any Catppuccin palette color, so they always stay in sync with the theme.\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  <img width=\"271\" height=\"650\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f608f9a3-a9d0-4e4e-b710-07dd27e5e57a\" />\n  </details>\n\n* **New Color Picker Screen:** A fully re-built color setting screen, complete with a Catppuccin color grid and color sliders.\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  <img width=\"275\" height=\"614\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64836381-572a-472d-ae2f-17bb20d27a5b\" />\n  </details>\n\n* **Tab View:** The Top Bar now uses the brand new Tab View widget and comes with a cool switching animation.\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  <img width=\"851\" height=\"66\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d87fa890-7be1-4778-adca-45057a6ca7cc\" />\n  </details>\n\n* **LongEdit Widget:** Added support for the new LongEdit setting widget.\n* **Watermark Toggle:** Added a setting to hide the \"Catppuccin Theme by Pindour\" watermark in the Modules Screen.\n\n## ✨ Added & Tweaks\n\n* **Buttons:** Buttons can now display an icon and text at the same time.\n* **Labels:** Label widgets now support custom text alignment.\n* **Scrollbar:** The scrollbar handle now sits on a background track (with an outline) for better visibility."
		},
