			"notes": "## 🚀 New Features\n\n* **Material 3 Expressive Slider:** A brand new look for sliders!\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  ![Slider](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f4648e2-b7a8-4386-bd05-e6bcb4f23028)\n  </details>\n\n* **Top Bar Icons:** Added all-new icons for the top bar (can be turned off in settings) - with API for Addon devs.\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  ![Top Bar Icons](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1eac001f-d5c7-4368-a922-fb84fb15bbf6)\n  </details>\n\n* **Setting Indents:** Settings with conditional visibility are now beautifully indented for better readability (can be turned off in settings).\n  <details>\n  <summary>Click to view image</summary>\n  \n  ![Setting Indents](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3566bd6-e830-401a-9a7e-9e449175a7c3)\n  </details>\n\n* **\"Back\" Animation:** Added a very epic new bounce effect animation for windows and sections.\n\n## ✨ Added & Tweaks\n\n* **Minecraft 26.2 Support**\n* **Checkbox:** Added \"tick\" icon and now uses the new \"back in out\" animation.\n* **File Setting Widget:** Added support for the new File Setting widget (26.2+).\n* **Dropdowns:** Added a smooth hover effect for dropdown buttons.\n\n## 🐛 Fixed\n\n* **Keybinds:** Restored the missing reset button for Keybinds (#26).\n* **Vector3D Widget:** Fixed the reset button being always visible and added indenting.\n* **Textboxes:** Fixed scaling issues for \"wide\" textboxes.\n* **Potion Widget:** Fixed a bug where the potion widget wasn't showing the potion's name.\n\n*And some additional behind-the-scenes tweaks and fixes.*"
		},
